"mtq0605" is the GitHub name of the author and copyright holder of LAE. It
is used as a pseudonym.

This file is an overview. It is not itself a licence.

This repository is not under a single licence. Every file either states its
licence in an SPDX header or is covered by REUSE.toml, following the REUSE
specification (https://reuse.software). If this overview and a file-level
statement differ, the file-level statement governs.

The full licence texts are in the LICENSES/ directory:

  LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt                 Apache License, Version 2.0
